{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 16 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生理时序模型：门控、膨胀卷积、长状态与领域预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Temporal Physiological AI</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn-title\">Temporal Convolutional Network (TCN)</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以因果、指数扩张的 1D 卷积残差块并行覆盖长历史，而不使用循环状态。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Stacks 1D causal convolutions with exponentially increasing dilation factors d = 2^l inside residual blocks to cover long historical receptive fields in parallel.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">长度 T 的多通道时间序列 X</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Multi-channel continuous physiological time series X ∈ R^{C×T}</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">逐时刻或序列级预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Causal step-wise sequence predictions or pooled episode classification</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.01271\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Temporal Convolutional Network (TCN) original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/0e79161ad60dafb69d91.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">序列 X</span><span class=\"lang-en\">sequence X</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">形状为 time×channels；可按任务做因果或固定窗口输入</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests multi-channel continuous physiological time series x ∈ r^{c×t} and prepares initial tensor representations (sequence X).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"形状为 time×channels；可按任务做因果或固定窗口输入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests multi-channel continuous physiological time series x ∈ r^{c×t} and prepares initial tensor representations (sequence X).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"序列 X\" data-node-name-en=\"sequence X\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">序列 X</span><span class=\"lang-en\">sequence X</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">形状为 time×channels；可按任务做因果或固定窗口输入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests multi-channel continuous physiological time series x ∈ r^{c×t} and prepares initial tensor representations (sequence X).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"左侧 padding 保证时刻 t 不读取未来样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Causal 1D Convolution to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"因果卷积\" data-node-name-en=\"Causal 1D Convolution\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">因果卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Causal 1D Convolution</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">左侧 padding 保证时刻 t 不读取未来样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Causal 1D Convolution to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"d=1,2,4... 的 1D kernel 指数扩大感受野\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Dilated 1D Convolution within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"扩张卷积\" data-node-name-en=\"Dilated 1D Convolution\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">扩张卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dilated 1D Convolution</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">d=1,2,4... 的 1D kernel 指数扩大感受野</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Dilated 1D Convolution within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"两层 dilated Conv、非线性、dropout/weight norm 加 residual branch\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs residual block within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"残差块\" data-node-name-en=\"residual block\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">残差块</span><span class=\"lang-en\">residual block</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两层 dilated Conv、非线性、dropout/weight norm 加 residual branch</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs residual block within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"通道不同时用 1×1 projection，再与 block 输出相加\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Residual / 1×1 within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Residual / 1×1\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual / 1×1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Residual / 1×1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">通道不同时用 1×1 projection，再与 block 输出相加</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Residual / 1×1 within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多个 dilation level 并行训练，覆盖固定的长历史窗口\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs hierarchical within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"层级堆叠\" data-node-name-en=\"hierarchical\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">层级堆叠</span><span class=\"lang-en\">hierarchical</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多个 dilation level 并行训练，覆盖固定的长历史窗口</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs hierarchical within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 kernel、dilation 和层数预先确定；超出窗口的信息不可见\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs receptive field within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"有效感受野\" data-node-name-en=\"receptive field\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">有效感受野</span><span class=\"lang-en\">receptive field</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 kernel、dilation 和层数预先确定；超出窗口的信息不可见</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs receptive field within the core causal dilated temporal convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐时刻 1×1 head 或全局 pooling 后分类/回归\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Task Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"任务头\" data-node-name-en=\"Task Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Task Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐时刻 1×1 head 或全局 pooling 后分类/回归</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Task Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"序列标签、分割或连续值\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces causal step-wise sequence predictions or pooled episode classification via prediction.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"预测\" data-node-name-en=\"prediction\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_078_temporal_convolutional_network__tcn', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预测</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">序列标签、分割或连续值</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces causal step-wise sequence predictions or pooled episode classification via prediction.</span></div></li>