 xlink:href=\"#m078_g22-17\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"143.867736\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g10-185\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"146.624094\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g19-18\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"150.83864\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g10-186\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"154.539623\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g7-17\" y=\"-61.927805\"></use><use x=\"160.543711\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g22-150\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"175.016047\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g22-51\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"180.207384\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g19-18\" y=\"-49.424719\"></use><use x=\"187.323741\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g4-61\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"196.427309\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g29-50\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"201.379541\" xlink:href=\"#m078_g19-18\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">RNN 串行计算且有效记忆长度不稳定</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Recurrent networks (LSTM/GRU) could not parallelize across time during training and exhibited unstable effective memory horizons.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用 causal dilated 1D convolution 与 residual blocks 建模长序列</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Combine strict causal padding (no future leakage) with exponentially dilated 1D convolutions (d=1, 2, 4, 8…) and residual shortcuts.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">并行卷积、指数扩张感受野和稳定残差优化</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Full temporal parallelization during training + exact, deterministic receptive field calculation R = 1 + Σ (k−1)·d_l + low streaming memory.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为 ECG/EEG 等生理信号强、便宜、稳定的 baseline</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Highly competitive, fast, and stable baseline for continuous ECG, EEG seizure detection, PPG, and EMG envelope decoding.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">长期实用；感受野由 dilation/depth 固定且全局自适应关系有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Practical first-line waveform baseline; receptive field is fixed by network depth/dilation and weights remain static across inputs.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">用因果卷积保证在线预测不泄漏未来，用 dilation 在较少层数下覆盖长时间范围。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">所有时间位置可并行计算，避免 RNN 的逐步隐藏状态依赖。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">残差块稳定深层训练，但可见历史范围由结构预先固定，不会按样本动态选择远程依赖。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Combine strict causal padding (no future leakage) with exponentially dilated 1D convolutions (d=1, 2, 4, 8…) and residual shortcuts.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Full temporal parallelization during training + exact, deterministic receptive field calculation R = 1 + Σ (k−1)·d_l + low streaming memory.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Causal Exponentially Dilated 1D Convolution Preserving Temporal Ordering.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">是 ECG/EEG 等等间隔生理信号的高吞吐强基线，尤其适合流式事件检测。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">不规则采样、跨小时缺口或依赖超出感受野时，需要时间编码、重采样或更长上下文机制。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Highly competitive, fast, and stable baseline for continuous ECG, EEG seizure detection, PPG, and EMG envelope decoding.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Practical first-line waveform baseline; receptive field is fixed by network depth/dilation and weights remain static across inputs.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.01271\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>An Empirical Evaluation of Generic Convolutional and Recurrent Networks for Sequence Modeling</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/locuslab/TCN\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
